{{-- A state chip: ✓ سليم / ! مراقبة / ✕ مشكلة / – لا بيانات. A glyph on an explicit background, so it needs no image, no script and survives dark mode.
  EMAIL-CLIENT-COMPAT-001: a FIXED width (not `min-width`, which the Gmail app drops) with px height and line-height, nowrap. Needs $state; optional $label (bool: add the word), $size (px). --}}
